  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve National and Regional Referral Mechanisms (NRMs/RRM) in cross-border cases of Trafficking in Human Beings (THB) in West Africa area</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project aims to improve the cross-sectoral response to Trafficking in Human Beings (THB) across the West Africa region, from identification and referral of victims of cross-border trafficking to adequate protection and (re)integration services.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
